config←ReadConfig;isOn;getEnv
getEnv←{2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment' ⍵}
isOn←{∨/'yY1'∊getEnv ⍵}
'config' ⎕NS ''

config.DEV←isOn 'DEV'
config.MODEL←getEnv 'MOD'
config.SILENT←isOn 'SIL'
config.DISPLAY_TRAPPED_ERRORS←isOn 'DISPLAY_TRAPPED_ERRORS' ⍝ Log all ⎕ELX/⎕ALX errors to the session
config.TRAP_DWI_ERRORS←isOn 'TRAP_DWI_ERRORS'               ⍝ "n" if you want to debug ∆WI
config.GITPATH←getEnv 'GITPATH'
config.STEP←getEnv 'STEP'
